    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Two readings, one corpus",
      "items": [
        "TypeScript reference and Python prototype must report the same codes on 87 cases",
        "A new case must fail on the previous published box"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Where it runs",
      "items": [
        "npx usedesign@<pin> in each product's CI — nothing installed, version frozen per repository; the frontend gate reads the server's cards via a sibling checkout",
